<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Network on Loong's Blog</title><link>https://adja.com.cn/en/tags/network/</link><description>Recent content in Network on Loong's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><copyright>Loong</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:20:44 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://adja.com.cn/en/tags/network/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Use DDNS To Access Intranet Devices</title><link>https://adja.com.cn/en/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jul 2024 16:08:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://adja.com.cn/en/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post Use DDNS To Access Intranet Devices" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices"&gt;Use DDNS To Access Intranet Devices
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt; Sometimes I need to access my home NAS when I go out.
Since it is increasingly challenging to apply for a public IPv4 in China, and the official QuickConnect service of Synology is also very slow.
After referring to relevant tutorials,
I decided to resolve the domain name to public IPv6 through DDNS and access the intranet devices directly through the domain name.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Based on the previous experiment of cracking the optical modem to get the superuser privileges to modify the routing mode,
I connected the router to the optical modem.
Then let the router dial and turn on IPv6, and after assigning the public network IPv6, I started the DDNS configuration process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="through-synologys-dns-service"&gt;Through Synology&amp;rsquo;s DNS service
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; Open the Control Panel, click External Access, select DDNS, then click Add, and select Synology as the service provider.
Then customize the configuration below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="1" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="352px" data-flex-grow="147" height="769" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/1.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/1_hu_69f201a0e4c480f3.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/1.png 1131w" width="1131"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; If you need https access, check &amp;ldquo;Get a certificate from Let&amp;rsquo;s Encrypt&amp;rdquo; and click OK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="using-a-dns-service-from-another-provider"&gt;Using a DNS service from another provider
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; The following only takes Tencent Cloud&amp;rsquo;s DNS service as an example. You need to apply for a domain name on Tencent Cloud&amp;rsquo;s official website in
advance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="using-the-ddns-go-image"&gt;Using the &lt;em&gt;ddns-go&lt;/em&gt; image
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt; To perform dynamic domain name resolution, you need your own NAS device to query the local IP address regularly, and then call the interface to
update the domain name resolution field to implement DDNS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; So you can&amp;rsquo;t change the method. There are many methods on the Internet. Here I provide a method to use Docker to update DDNS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Search for Docker in the package center and install Docker. The steps are omitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="3" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="497px" data-flex-grow="207" height="661" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/3.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/3_hu_eca8b7d01b1fc388.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/3.png 1371w" width="1371"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Open Docker, select &amp;ldquo;Registry&amp;rdquo;, search for ddns, and install the first &amp;ldquo;ddns-go&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="4" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="420px" data-flex-grow="175" height="841" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/4.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/4_hu_1a857ad7af926065.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/4.png 1475w" width="1475"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; After the installation is complete, open the image, select ddns-go, and click Start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="5" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="677px" data-flex-grow="282" height="520" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/5.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/5_hu_50f76bffd33e54f1.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/5.png 1467w" width="1467"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Click Advanced Settings-&amp;gt;Storage-&amp;gt;Add Folder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="6" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="349px" data-flex-grow="145" height="843" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/6.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/6_hu_b13acdd7557fda94.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/6.png 1229w" width="1229"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Modify the mount path, my configuration is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="7" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="378px" data-flex-grow="157" height="744" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/7.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/7_hu_ecbcbb4a0ad9a4b8.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/7.png 1174w" width="1174"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Click Network-&amp;gt;Check Host Network-&amp;gt;Apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="8" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="282px" data-flex-grow="117" height="822" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/8.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/8_hu_f99871db60269c12.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/8.png 966w" width="966"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Click Next, click Finish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="configuring-ddns"&gt;Configuring DDNS
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt; Open &lt;code&gt;http://[nas ip corresponding to the domain name]:9876/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="9" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="519px" data-flex-grow="216" height="490" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/9.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/9_hu_925b9fdb642161f3.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/9.png 1061w" width="1061"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Configure DNS service provider, select Tencent Cloud, enter ID and Token, &lt;font color=red&gt;Note that the ID and Token here correspond to &amp;ldquo;DNSPod
Token&amp;rdquo;, not &amp;ldquo;Tencent Cloud API Key&amp;rdquo;&lt;/font&gt;, the link is https:
//console.dnspod.cn/account/token/token&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Only enable ipv6, my configuration is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="10" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="431px" data-flex-grow="179" height="579" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/10.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/10_hu_16fb044404419bdd.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/10.png 1041w" width="1041"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Before clicking &amp;ldquo;Save&amp;rdquo;, you need to configure the domain name resolution and add an AAAA type (indicating an IPv6 address) record.
Fill it out and it will automatically update. My configuration is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="11" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1098px" data-flex-grow="457" height="356" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/11.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/11_hu_53f18511fd287e58.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/11_hu_34fd2a7dcdc69cff.png 1600w, https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/11.png 1629w" width="1629"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; After the configuration is completed, click Save, and the latest history records will appear on the right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="12" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="375px" data-flex-grow="156" height="344" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/use-ddns-to-access-intranet-devices/12.png" width="538"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Finally, you can test it through domain name + port.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="additional"&gt;Additional
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; In the summer of 2022, after the installation was completed, I asked my classmates to help test the speed of different prefecture-level cities
in Jiangsu. The speed was still quite fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; After graduation, I went to other provinces.
After finding my first job.
I thought about NAS again and tried to continue using it,
but found that the same method did not work at all, mainly because the network infrastructure varies greatly between provinces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; If you are in a province where IPv6 has not been promoted, it is recommended to Avoid tossing. In addition, due to the proliferation of &lt;em&gt;PCDN&lt;/em&gt;
in the past few years, operators will check whether users have built &lt;em&gt;PCDN&lt;/em&gt; based on the upstream speed of bandwidth. If DDNS is used maliciously, it
may cause broadband to be blocked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=3 color=blue&gt;2022-06-19 Record&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=3 color=blue&gt;2023-07-07 Update&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Crack The Optical Modem Superuser Password</title><link>https://adja.com.cn/en/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/</link><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jun 2022 15:43:59 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://adja.com.cn/en/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post Crack The Optical Modem Superuser Password" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password"&gt;Crack The Optical Modem Superuser Password
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt; First of all, I want to emphasize that the optical modem model is &lt;em&gt;HS8545M5&lt;/em&gt;, and the software version is &lt;em&gt;V5R020C00S200&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Since the optical modem needs to be in routing mode by default when it is shipped, I need to change it to bridge mode.
However, the user on the back of the optical modem does not have the permission to modify it, so I need to get superuser permissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="1" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="302px" data-flex-grow="126" height="1145" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/1.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/1_hu_b560fd1c3f4c6337.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/1.png 1443w" width="1443"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="enable-telnet-on-the-optical-modem"&gt;Enable Telnet on the optical modem
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt; The telnet service is not enabled on the optical modem, so we need a tool to crack it. The download link of the cracking tool is at the end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; First download the cracking tool, then unplug the optical fiber, restart the optical modem, connect the computer to the optical modem via the broadband cable, and open the ONT maintenance enabling tool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Select maintenance enabling, click refresh, and then start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; When the &amp;ldquo;current total number of successes&amp;rdquo; becomes 1, click stop, and the result is similar to the screenshot below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="2" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="387px" data-flex-grow="161" height="884" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/2.png" srcset="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/2_hu_b029e86027759574.png 800w, https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/2.png 1426w" width="1426"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; Open the command line and test whether telnet can connect successfully. If the command cannot be found, start the telnet service of Windows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;telnet 192.168.1.1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt; Then enter the username root; try the password &lt;code&gt;Hw8@cMcc&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;adminHW&lt;/code&gt;. If successful, the result is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="3" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="313px" data-flex-grow="130" height="534" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://adja.com.cn/p/crack-the-optical-modem-superuser-password/3.png" width="697"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
