&lt;p&gt; Open the file huawei.exe in the Huawei secondary password cracking tool S1S2 Voice Full Authentication.zip, enter the password in the ciphertext decryption, try 3 decryption methods, and get the password as &lt;code&gt;CMCCAdminFf2IrXFt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
